@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-32 View All Orders

class "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "PaymentController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "PaymentService" as Service <<service>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "StatusHistory" as StatusHistory <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : GET /payments/orders
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> StatusHistory : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses

note right of UI
UC-32 - View All Orders
Actors: Admin, Manager
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Danh sách tất cả orders hiển thị
end note
@enduml
